=1791949528" width="600" alt="" style="display:block;width:100%;height:auto;border:0;"></td></tr><tr><td background="https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0725/1188/1261/files/ayni26-hero-colca.jpg?v=1793308591" bgcolor="#2a1c13" valign="bottom" style="background:#2a1c13 url('https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0725/1188/1261/files/ayni26-hero-colca.jpg?v=1793308591') center / cover no-repeat;height:430px;" class="hero"><table role="presentation" width="100%" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0"><tr><td class="px" style="padding:150px 40px 46px;text-align:center;"><p style="margin:0 0 14px;font:700 12px/1 Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;letter-spacing:3px;text-transform:uppercase;color:#f4d5a4;">The Ayni Holiday Event &middot; Mon 11/23 to Giving Tuesday 12/1</p><h1 class="h1" style="margin:0;font:400 52px/1.04 'Marcellus', Georgia, 'Times New Roman', serif;color:#ffffff;">Buy 2 lb,<br><span style="color:#e2ab43;">get 1 lb free.</span></h1><p style="margin:18px auto 0;max-width:420px;font:italic 400 18px/1.5 'Lora', Georgia, 'Times New Roman', serif;color:#fbefd9;">Every pound you take comes with a free half pound of the same cacao, to keep or to pass on.</p></td></tr></table></td></tr><tr><td class="px" style="background:#fbf1e1;padding:44px 48px 14px;"><p style="margin:0 0 18px;font:400 18px/1.7 'Lora', Georgia, 'Times New Roman', serif;color:#4a3324;">Ayni is the Andean way of sacred reciprocity: when you give, you receive. Once a year we live it out loud.</p><p style="margin:0 0 18px;font:400 18px/1.7 'Lora', Georgia, 'Times New Roman', serif;color:#4a3324;">We learned Ayni from the families we work with in Peru. They care for old cacao trees the way their families always have, make the paste at the farm and wrap every bar there. We pay them 3x above fair trade, and we buy direct, with no broker in between. This week is our way of passing that on.</p></td></tr><tr><td class="px" style="background:#fbf1e1;padding:40px 48px 18px;"><p style="margin:0 0 10px;font:700 12px/1 Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;letter-spacing:3px;text-transform:uppercase;color:#c53e15;">How it works</p><h2 class="h2" style="margin:0 0 20px;font:400 34px/1.15 'Marcellus', Georgia, 'Times New Roman', serif;color:#5c402f;">The free cacao adds itself.</h2><table role="presentation" width="100%" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0"><tr><td width="58" valign="top" style="padding:0 0 22px;font:400 30px/1 'Marcellus', Georgia, 'Times New Roman', serif;color:#c18d1a;">01</td><td style="padding:0 0 22px;"><p style="margin:0 0 4px;font:600 19px/1.4 'Lora', Georgia, 'Times New Roman', serif;color:#5c402f;">Pick your pounds.</p><p style="margin:0;font:400 17px/1.6 'Lora', Georgia, 'Times New Roman', serif;color:#4a3324;">Any 1 lb bag or bar, ground, paste or a blend. Mix them however you like.</p></td></tr><tr><td width="58" valign="top" style="padding:0 0 22px;font:400 30px/1 'Marcellus', Georgia, 'Times New Roman', serif;color:#c18d1a;">02</td><td style="padding:0 0 22px;"><p style="margin:0 0 4px;font:600 19px/1.4 'Lora', Georgia, 'Times New Roman', serif;color:#5c402f;">Your free cacao appears.</p><p style="margin:0;font:400 17px/1.6 'Lora', Georgia, 'Times New Roman', serif;color:#4a3324;">For every pound in your cart, a half pound of the same cacao drops in at $0. 2 lb brings 1 lb free. A 5 lb bag brings 2 lb free.</p></td></tr><tr><td width="58" valign="top" style="padding:0 0 22px;font:400 30px/1 'Marcellus', Georgia, 'Times New Roman', serif;color:#c18d1a;">03</td><td style="padding:0 0 22px;"><p style="margin:0 0 4px;font:600 19px/1.4 'Lora', Georgia, 'Times New Roman', serif;color:#5c402f;">Check out.</p><p style="margin:0;font:400 17px/1.6 'Lora', Georgia, 'Times New Roman', serif;color:#4a3324;">No code to enter. The free cacao is for full price orders, so it doesn&rsquo;t combine with codes or subscriptions.</p></td></tr></table></td></tr><tr><td class="px" style="background:#fbf1e1;padding:6px 24px 34px;"><table role="presentation" align="center" cellpadding="0" cellsp