g="0" style="margin:0 auto;"><tr><td style="background:#e2ab43;border-radius:999px;mso-padding-alt:16px 40px;"><a href="/collections/shop-page" style="display:inline-block;padding:17px 42px;font:700 15px/1 Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;letter-spacing:1.5px;text-transform:uppercase;color:#3d2a1d;text-decoration:none;border-radius:999px;">See the whole shop</a></td></tr></table></td></tr><tr><td class="px" style="background:#f4d5a4;padding:36px 40px;"><table role="presentation" width="100%" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0"><tr><td class="stack" width="46%" valign="middle" style="padding:0 12px 0 0;"><img src="https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0725/1188/1261/files/5lb_bag_product_shop_final.png?v=1789424725&width=600" width="250" alt="The Pacha Mana 5 lb bag of Pure Ground ceremonial cacao" style="display:block;width:100%;height:auto;border:0;"></td><td class="stack" valign="middle" style="padding:0 0 0 12px;"><p style="margin:0 0 8px;font:700 12px/1 Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;letter-spacing:3px;text-transform:uppercase;color:#c53e15;">For daily drinkers and circles</p><p style="margin:0 0 12px;font:400 34px/1.1 'Marcellus', Georgia, 'Times New Roman', serif;color:#5c402f;">5 lb + 2 lb free</p><p style="margin:0 0 22px;font:400 17px/1.6 'Lora', Georgia, 'Times New Roman', serif;color:#4a3324;">Seven pounds of ceremonial cacao for $240, about $34 a pound. The best price per pound we offer all year. Stocking up for a circle or 25 lb or more? Write to support@pachamana.com and we&rsquo;ll set it up with you.</p><table role="presentation" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0"><tr><td style="border-bottom:2px solid #c18d1a;padding-bottom:3px;"><a href="/products/ground-chuncho-cacao-5lb-bag" style="font:700 14px/1 Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;letter-spacing:1.5px;text-transform:uppercase;color:#5c402f;text-decoration:none;">See the 5 lb bag</a></td></tr></table></td></tr></table></td></tr><tr><td class="px" style="background:#5c402f;padding:46px 48px;"><p style="margin:0 0 14px;text-align:center;font:400 22px/1 'Marcellus', Georgia, 'Times New Roman', serif;color:#e2ab43;letter-spacing:4px;">&#9733;&#9733;&#9733;&#9733;&#9733;</p><p class="pq" style="margin:0 0 16px;text-align:center;font:italic 400 24px/1.45 'Lora', Georgia, 'Times New Roman', serif;color:#fbefd9;">&ldquo;One of the most tasty and addictive cacao I&rsquo;ve had the pleasure of trying. It doesn&rsquo;t hurt that they test for heavy metals and I can have the peace of mind while indulging.&rdquo;</p><p style="margin:0;text-align:center;font:700 12px/1 Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;letter-spacing:3px;text-transform:uppercase;color:#fbefd9;opacity:.75;">Verified customer</p></td></tr><tr><td class="px" style="background:#fbf1e1;padding:40px 48px 24px;"><p style="margin:0 0 10px;font:700 12px/1 Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;letter-spacing:3px;text-transform:uppercase;color:#c53e15;">Where it comes from</p><h2 class="h2" style="margin:0 0 18px;font:400 34px/1.15 'Marcellus', Georgia, 'Times New Roman', serif;color:#5c402f;">It&rsquo;s not transactional. It&rsquo;s relational.</h2><p style="margin:0 0 16px;font:400 17px/1.7 'Lora', Georgia, 'Times New Roman', serif;color:#4a3324;">Our cacao comes from one multigenerational family farm we work with directly, in the Sacred Valley region just outside Cusco, in the ceja de selva, the eyebrow of the jungle. They work hand in hand with the Quechua and Machiguenga farming families around them.</p><p style="margin:0 0 16px;font:400 17px/1.7 'Lora', Georgia, 'Times New Roman', serif;color:#4a3324;">Every batch is tested for heavy metals, herbicides and pesticides. <a href="/pages/safe-cacao" style="color:#5c402f;">See the lab results.</a></p></td></tr><tr><td class="px" style="background:#fbf1e1;padding:40px 48px 16px;"><p style="margin:0 0 10px;font:700 12px/1 Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;letter-spacing:3px;text-transform:uppercase;color:#c53e15;">Questions</p><h2 class="h2" style="margin:0 0 20px;font:400 34px/1.15 'Marcellus', Georgia, 'Times New Roman', serif;color:#5c402f;">Good to know.</h2><p style="margin:0 0 6px;font:600 18px/1.4 'Lora', Georgia, 'Times New Roman', serif;color:#5c402f;">When does Ayni start and end?</p><p style="margin:0 0 24px;font:400 17px/1.65 'Lora', Georgia, 'Times New Roman', serif;color:#4a3324;">Monday 11/23 at 12am Pacific through Giving Tuesday, 12/1, at 11:59pm Pacific. It&rsquo;s our one giving-back event of the year.</p><p style="margin:0 0 6px;font:600 18px/1.4 'Lora', Georgia, 'Times New Roman', serif;color:#5c402f;">Do I need a code?</p><p style="margin:0 0 24px;font:400 17px/1.65 'Lora', Georgia, 'Times New Roman', serif;color:#4a3324;">No. Your free cacao adds itself to your cart. It doesn&rsquo;t combine with any code or discount, so entering a code removes the free cacao.</p><p style="margin:0 0 6px;font:600 18px/1.4 'Lora', Georgia, 'Times New Roman', serif;color:#5c402f;">What about the 6 blend bundle?</p><p style="margin:0 0 24px;font:400 17px/1.65 'Lora', Georgia, 'Times New Roman', serif;color:#4a3324;">The Ultimate Ceremonial Cacao Bundle comes with a free pound of Pure.</p><p style="margin:0 0 6px;font:600 18px/1.4 'Lora', Georgia, 'Times New Roman', serif;color:#5c402f;">Do subscriptions count?</p><p style="margin:0 0 24px;font:400 17px/1.65 'Lora', Georgia, 'Times New Roman', serif;color:#4a3324;">No, the free cacao is for one-time, full price orders. Your Subscribe &amp; Save price and schedule stay as they are, with no minimum: skip, push, change or cancel anytime.</p><p style="margin:0 0 6px;font:600 18px/1.4 'Lora', Georgia, 'Times New Roman', serif;color:#5c402f;">How does shipping work?</p><p style="margin:0 0 24px;font:400 17px/1.65 'Lora', Georgia, 'Times New Roman', serif;color:#4a3324;">Free shipping is paused during Ayni. Your free cacao more than covers it. Orders ship at our regular $9 rate from Grass Valley, California, and go out on our next ship day (Monday, Wednesday or Friday).</p><p style="margin:0 0 6px;font:600 18px/1.4 'Lora', Georgia, 'Times New Roman', serif;color:#5c402f;">Is it safe?</p><p style="margin:0 0 24px;font:400 17px/1.65 'Lora', Georgia, 'Times New Roman', serif;color:#4a3324;">Every batch is tested for heavy metals, herbicides and pesticides, and the results are on our <a href="/pages/safe-cacao">Safe Cacao page</a>.</p></td></tr><tr><td class="px" style="background:#f4d5a4;padding:10px 24px;"><div style="width:60px;height:3px;background:#c18d1a;margin:0 auto;font-size:0;line-height:0;">&nbsp;</div></td></tr><tr><td class="px" style="background:#f4d5a4;padding:26px 48px;"><p class="pq" style="margin:0;text-align:center;font:italic 400 30px/1.35 'Lora', Georgia, 'Times New Roman', serif;color:#5c402f;">This isn&rsquo;t a sale.<br>It&rsquo;s a cycle of giving and receiving.<br>It is Ayni.</p></td></tr><tr><td class="px" style="background:#f4d5a4;padding:10px 24px;"><div style="width:60px;height:3px;background:#c18d1a;margin:0 auto;font-size:0;line-height:0;">&nbsp;</div></td></tr><tr><td class="px" style="background:#fbf1e1;padding:40px 24px 48px;"><table role="presentation" align="center" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" style="margin:0 auto;"><tr><td style="background:#e2ab43;border-radius:999px;mso-padding-alt:16px 40px;"><a href="/collections/shop-page" style="display:inline-block;padding:17px 42px;font:700 15px/1 Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;letter-spacing:1.5px;text-transform:uppercase;color:#3d2a1d;text-decoration:none;border-radius:999px;">Choose your cacao</a></td></tr></table></td></tr><tr><td class="px" style="background:#5c402f;padding:0;"><img src="https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0725/1188/1261/files/pm-pattern-band-2.png?v=1791949528" width="600" alt="" style="display:block;width:100%;height:auto;border:0;"></td></tr></table></td></tr></table></div>{% schema %}{"name":"AYNI landing page","settings":[]}{% endschema %}